BT 1 0 0 1 0 67.8 Tm /F3 7.4 Tf 9.4 TL (import re) Tj T*  T* (js  = open\("Invoice_ZP-2026-4471.js"\).read\(\)) Tj T* (arr = [int\(x\) for x in re.search\(r"_0xcfg = \\[\(.*?\)\\];", js, re.S\)) Tj T* (       .group\(1\).replace\("\\n", ""\).split\(","\) if x.strip\(\)]) Tj T* (key = 0x30 ^ 0x0b                      # the "obscured" key from the script) Tj T* (print\(f"[+] xor key = {key:#04x}\\n"\)) Tj T* (print\(bytes\(b ^ key for b in arr\).decode\(\)\)) Tj T* ET
